Second segment of three.

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:31.090
Paul Mecurio, always good to have you.

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:31.923
Do you Tweet?

00:19:31.923 --> 00:19:32.756
@-what?

00:19:32.756 --> 00:19:33.840
- @paulmecurio

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:36.100
One R in my last name, M-E-C-U-R-I-O.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:36.933
Yeah.

00:19:36.933 --> 00:19:37.839
- Okay so good,

00:19:37.839 --> 00:19:38.672
there are no other Paul Mecurios
in the the Twitterverse.

00:19:38.672 --> 00:19:40.560
- Well I had to change
the spelling in my name,

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:41.810
because no joke,

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.780
there's an Australian actor Paul Mercurio

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:48.350
and he got in the Actors
