00:27:36.887 --> 00:27:38.740
- It just seems to me,
you solve problems faster.

00:27:38.740 --> 00:27:39.573
That's all.

00:27:39.573 --> 00:27:42.053
Smarter people don't
have telekinetic powers.

00:27:42.900 --> 00:27:43.733
