00:27:58.780 --> 00:27:59.831
- He was a really smart guy.

00:27:59.831 --> 00:28:00.664
- Right.

00:28:00.664 --> 00:28:02.637
So but with all of our abilities--

00:28:02.637 --> 00:28:05.210
- So I'm intrigued by
that branch of science.

00:28:05.210 --> 00:28:06.210
- It's fascinating.

00:28:06.210 --> 00:28:07.043
- That's what started the question.

00:28:07.043 --> 00:28:09.430
