00:29:03.460 --> 00:29:05.310
Now we stop it for the universe.

00:29:05.310 --> 00:29:06.800
- Ahh.
- I'm loving it.

00:29:06.800 --> 00:29:09.400
So anyway, so I get a word, you ready?

00:29:09.400 --> 00:29:14.030
Every word in the Oxford
English Dictionary

00:29:14.030 --> 00:29:18.550
