00:29:23.480 --> 00:29:25.987
- Okay so if I look up a
definition of something, it's--

00:29:25.987 --> 00:29:29.420
- All the words they
assemble to define that word

00:29:29.420 --> 00:29:31.860
are themselves, each one of those,

00:29:31.860 --> 00:29:32.820
is in the Oxford English Dictionary.

00:29:32.820 --> 00:29:35.150
- So it's not possible
to have a word in there

00:29:35.150 --> 00:29:36.550
that is not in the dictionary

00:29:36.550 --> 00:29:38.410
but is indeed a word.

00:29:38.410 --> 00:29:41.070
- Because then, that's why it
would be in the dictionary,

00:29:41.070 --> 00:29:41.903
defined.

00:29:41.903 --> 00:29:44.850
- But how do we know that
they have it covered?

00:29:44.850 --> 00:29:46.610
- We don't, but what we do know--

00:29:46.610 --> 00:29:47.443
- I'm not even being funny there,

00:29:47.443 --> 00:29:48.276
you know what I mean?

00:29:48.276 --> 00:29:49.109
You got a limit--

00:29:49.109 --> 00:29:53.430
- We don't, but we know
that they have it covered

00:29:53.430 --> 00:29:55.170
better than anyone else.

00:29:55.170 --> 00:29:57.640
It is their singular mission in life

00:29:57.640 --> 00:30:00.810
