from some colleagues,

00:33:05.890 --> 00:33:08.201
was to learn that Saturn's ring system

00:33:08.201 --> 00:33:10.900
might just be temporary.

00:33:10.900 --> 00:33:11.733
- [Paul] Why?

00:33:11.733 --> 00:33:13.450
